       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INITIALIZEDEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 CUSTOMER-RECORD.
           05 CUST-NAME PIC X(15) VALUE "PENDING".
           05 CUST-BALANCE PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 100.50.
           05 CUST-COUNT PIC 9(3) VALUE 7.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "BEFORE: " CUST-NAME " " CUST-BALANCE " " CUST-COUNT
           INITIALIZE CUSTOMER-RECORD
           DISPLAY "AFTER: " CUST-NAME " " CUST-BALANCE " " CUST-COUNT
           STOP RUN.
